### Create note
POST http://localhost:3000/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "AI interview",
  "content": "Prepare coding agent architecture",
  "tags": ["Interview", "AI", "python", "ai"]
}

### Search notes
GET http://localhost:3000/notes?q=architecture

### Filter by tag
GET http://localhost:3000/notes?tag=ai

### Multiple tags (AND semantics)
GET http://localhost:3000/notes?tags=ai,python

### Sorted and paginated
GET http://localhost:3000/notes?sortBy=updatedAt&order=desc&page=1&limit=10

### Tag summary
GET http://localhost:3000/notes/tags
